  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Jesus administers sacrament to Nephites, 3 Ne. 18:1–4, 8–9 (20:3–7; 26:13). one shall be ordained with power to administer sacrament, 3 Ne. 18:5. bread in remembrance of Christ’s body, 3 Ne. 18:6–7 (20:8). partaking of sacrament witnesses that partaker will keep commandments, 3 Ne. 18:10. those baptized shall receive sacrament, 3 Ne. 18:11. wine in remembrance of Christ’s blood, 3 Ne. 18:11 (20:8). unworthy not to be allowed to partake of sacrament, 3 Ne. 18:28–29. prayer for sacrament bread, Moro. 4:3. prayer for sacrament wine, Moro. 5:2. Nephites meet oft to partake of bread and wine in remembrance of Jesus, Moro. 6:6.",
